{"id":"636839","name":"海参捞饭","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/636839/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"即食海参","amount":"2个（2人份）"},{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"西蓝花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/636839/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鹌鹑蛋、海参烫20秒钟。","img":"images/636839/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内加水烧开，放盐下入西蓝花，焯水断生。","img":"images/636839/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒸好的米饭。","img":"images/636839/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盛入碗里。","img":"images/636839/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"米饭倒扣过来，摆上西蓝花、海参、鹌鹑蛋。","img":"images/636839/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上海参、鲍鱼汁。","img":"images/636839/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636839/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"美味。","img":"images/636839/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}